# Floating cards (decision 081): a card apart from the island, in its look,
# while the island keeps showing its pill. Several at once, from several providers.

scenario: the pill opens the card floating, and sends it back
start timer float
click                               -> Compact floats=timer focused=timer front=timer expanded=none
click                               -> Compact floats=none focused=none   # again: back into the pill
click                               -> floats=timer
close-float timer                   -> Compact floats=none

scenario: the bubble toggles its activity's floating card too
start timer float
start media                         -> top=media
bubble                              -> Split floats=timer
bubble                              -> Split floats=none

scenario: Esc sends the focused card back, unless its provider said not to
start timer float
click
esc                                 -> Compact floats=none
start notes float=noesc
click
esc                                 -> floats=notes focused=notes
close-float notes                   -> floats=none

scenario: Esc with no floating card focused is the island's
start timer float
click
focus-float none
esc                                 -> Compact floats=timer

scenario: floating cards from several providers at once
start media by=music
start timer float by=clock
start notes float by=pad            -> top=notes
click                               -> floats=notes front=notes Split
promote timer
click                               -> floats=notes,timer front=timer focused=timer Split
focus-float notes                   -> focused=notes
focus-float gone                    -> focused=none          # not one of ours

scenario: one provider can float many cards: no limit, one per card
start a float by=p
click
start b float by=p
click
start c float by=p
click
start d float by=p
click                               -> floats=a,b,c,d Split

scenario: a tab or a widget brings an open floating card to the front, never back
start timer float
start notes float
start media
click                               -> Expanded expanded=media
switch timer                        -> Split floats=timer focused=timer expanded=none
promote notes
click                               -> floats=timer,notes front=notes
promote media
click
switch timer                        -> floats=timer,notes front=timer   # open: to the front, not back

scenario: from Home, the card floats and the island goes back to its pill
panel focus float
click                               -> expanded=home
tile focus                          -> Idle floats=focus expanded=none
esc                                 -> Idle floats=none      # the floating card had the keys
panel todo float
click
pin                                 -> stay=yes
tile todo                           -> Expanded expanded=home floats=todo   # pinned: Home stays (decision 046)

scenario: a floating card goes with its card, and stays for a dormant panel
panel focus float
start focus float
click                               -> floats=focus
end focus                           -> floats=focus          # the panel's dormant card
unpanel focus                       -> floats=none focused=none

scenario: the provider can send its card back
start search float
click
close-card search                   -> floats=none

scenario: a floating card's question is its own, focused or not
start timer float
start media
promote timer
click
focus-float none
ask timer                           -> dialog=timer
promote media
click                               -> Expanded expanded=media dialog=timer
ask media                           -> dialog=media,timer
close-dialog                        -> dialog=timer          # the island had the keys
focus-float timer
close-dialog                        -> dialog=none Expanded  # taking the keys alone doesn't close the island's card

scenario: typing is on the card that has the keys, and its text waits when it loses them
start notes float
click
focus notes add
type hello                          -> draft=hello
focus-float none                    -> draft=none
focus notes add                     -> draft=none            # not the focused card
focus-float notes
focus notes add                     -> draft=hello           # kept (decision 050)

scenario: a floating card's toast goes by itself
start todo float
click
toast todo                          -> toast=todo
wait 4999                           -> toast=todo
wait 1                              -> toast=none floats=todo

scenario: a fullscreen app hides floating cards with the island; they come back with it
start timer float
click
hide                                -> Hidden floats=timer focused=none
show                                -> Compact floats=timer
alert battery critical              -> Alert floats=timer    # a critical alert leaves them

scenario: a resized card never goes below floatMinSize; until resized, it fits its content
start notes float
click                               -> size=notes:none
resize-float notes 600 500          -> size=notes:600x500
resize-float notes 100 100          -> size=notes:320x160

scenario: the activity shortcut toggles its floating card, as the pill does
start timer float
click
focus-float none
open-activity                       -> Compact floats=none
open-activity                       -> Compact floats=timer focused=timer
